et-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>The solid is a <strong>heptagonal pyramid</strong> since it is a pyramid whose base is a heptagon.</p>\n<p>Also, notice that:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>The solid is not a triangular pyramid since not all its faces are triangular.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>The solid is not a heptagonal prism since it has only one heptagonal face.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>The solid is not a hexagonal prism because it has no hexagonal face.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>The solid is not a cube since it has triangular faces.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div>",
